<title>ITALY: SOCCER-JUVENTUS 2 AJAX 1 - LATEST.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-JUVENTUS 2 AJAX 1 - LATEST.</headline>
<dateline>TURIN, Italy 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Juventus of Italy led Ajax</p>
<p>of the Netherlands 2-1 in their European Cup semifinal second</p>
<p>leg on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers</p>
<p>Juventus - Attilio Lombardo 34, Christian Vieri 36</p>
<p>Ajax - Mario Melchiot 76</p>
<p>Aggregate score: 4-2 to Juventus</p>
</text>
